    "claim": "The complete LLVM graph plus callback-table rewriting automatically extracted 62 additional built-in C function definitions from four source files into four lazy modules; build, MODPOST, strict size, lifecycle, concurrency, same-FD reload, and 16-pair startup gates passed.",
